     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRPregnancyHistoryLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRPregnancyHistoryLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRPregnancyHistoryLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-pregnancy-history</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-historique-de-la-grossesse.html\">CDA - FR Historique de la grossesseversion: 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.statusCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.directSubject[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.subject</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.method</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la méthode au niveau de l'entrée FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.observationDate[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.effectiveTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.result</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.component:frObservationSurLaGrossesse</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.interpretation</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à l'interprétation au niveau de l'entrée FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.note</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié au commentaire au niveau de l'entrée FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.component</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.component:frNaissance</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.derivedFrom[x]</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la traçabilité de la source au niveau de l'entrée FRCDAHistoriqueDeLaGrossesse.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMPregnancyHistory.hasMember